# SemanticScript standard-library canonical module: standard.map.

# rationale: Canonical standard-library module for map size/capacity bookkeeping helpers.
# invariant: This module owns structural map helpers over entry counts, capacity, and known-key facts.
module standard.map
purpose module standard.map "Canonical standard-library module for map size/capacity bookkeeping helpers."
moduleOwns standard.map "The official import path `standard.map` and the executable `map.*` helper surface."
moduleDoesNotOwn standard.map "Concrete key hashing, probing, entry storage, put/get lookup, or container allocation."
invariant module standard.map "This module owns structural map helpers over entry counts, capacity, and known-key facts."
moduleWarning standard.map "This is bookkeeping only: `standard.map` does not store keys or values, and it does not provide executable `put`/`get` container operations."

